+// Ask the compositor for a repaint from outside its loop. The compositor stops waking on
+// the vblank grid when it has nothing pending (A54), so a repaint request must also wake
+// it. One nudge per painted frame: a request while one is outstanding is already covered.
+void wlserver_request_repaint()
+{
+	if ( !hasRepaint.exchange( true ) )
+		nudge_steamcompmgr();
+}
